128
00:08:01,651 --> 00:08:06,120
The script can state a personal choice and
compare documented traits.

129
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:11,238
It cannot convert that choice into a
scientific fact or imply routine danger to

130
00:08:11,238 --> 00:08:13,635
humans where no such evidence exists.

131
00:08:13,635 --> 00:08:18,215
The scariest deep-sea creature is partly
an animal and partly the story our brain

132
00:08:18,215 --> 00:08:19,176
writes around it.

133
00:08:19,176 --> 00:08:20,747
My vote is the anglerfish.

134
00:08:20,747 --> 00:08:25,760
The science answer is that fear depends on
the feature you react to—and the context

135
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,331
